cpu_features
------------------------------------------
A cross-platform C library to retrieve CPU features (such as available
instructions) at runtime.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.7.0-0.622.g80df0a2b5d6b
  libcpu_features-devel-0.11.0-1bl3
  libcpu_features0-0.11.0-1bl3
  pkg-config-3.0.8-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgmock-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/google/cpu_features

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/google/cpu_features/archive/refs/tags/v0.11.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack cpu_features-0.11.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./cpu_features-0.11.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/cpu_features-0.11.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/cpu_features-0.11.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcpu_features0-0.11.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcpu_features-devel-0.11.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(cpu_features)
  /usr/bin/list_cpu_features.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/cpu_features.README
  /usr/share/doc/cpu_features/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/cpu_features/README.md

(libcpu_features0)
  /usr/bin/cygcpu_features-0.dll

(libcpu_features-devel)
  /usr/include/cpu_features/cpu_features_cache_info.h
  /usr/include/cpu_features/cpu_features_macros.h
  /usr/include/cpu_features/cpuinfo_x86.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/CpuFeatures/CpuFeaturesConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/CpuFeatures/CpuFeaturesConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/CpuFeatures/CpuFeaturesTargets-release.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/CpuFeatures/CpuFeaturesTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libcpu_features.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/cpu_features.pc

